# This recipe unpacks the SAME .run as Recipes/Nvidia/615.71.09 but ships only
# the userspace half of the Arch-style split (nvidia-utils). Nothing is
# compiled: the .run is a self-extracting binary archive (uncompress=no,
# recipe_type=manifest) and the libraries/tools/JSONs are copied verbatim.

# file_size/file_md5 provenance: identical to the Nvidia recipe. NVIDIA
# publishes NO checksum for the .run; both values were verified locally on
# 2026-10-19 (see Recipes/Nvidia/615.71.09/Resources/BuildInformation for the
# full note, including why the archive header's MD5 field is the payload CRC
# and must not be used here).

